  "prefLabel": "Pod 502.02 Noncompliance with Standards as Unprofessional Conduct",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pod 502.02 Noncompliance with Standards as Unprofessional Conduct. The ethical standards set forth in this part shall bind all licensees, and noncompliance with these standards shall constitute unprofessional conduct as used in RSA 310:12, I(d).\n\nSource. #12149, eff 3-25-17; ss by #14616, eff 7-1-26, EXPIRES: 7-1-36",
